      "Breakfast",
      "Kaya & Shokupan Set",
      "$14.90",
      "Our take on the classic Singaporean–Malaysian breakfast. Soft, fluffy house-made milk bread served with fragrant pandan kaya, whipped butter and two half-boiled eggs. Enjoy with soy sauce and white pepper for the perfect balance of sweet and savoury.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "Extra half-boiled egg",
      "+$2.00",
      "Whipped butter",
      "+$1.50",
      "Kaya",
      "+$2.50",
      "Extra bread",
      "+$4.00",
      "Lao Gan Ma Hot Honey Stracciatella",
      "$20.90",
      "Creamy Italian stracciatella paired with sweet, lightly charred peaches and our Lao Gan Ma hot honey. Finished with toasted pistachios and served with sourdough for a playful combination of creamy, sweet, spicy and savoury flavours.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "Prosciutto (25 g)",
      "+$5.00",
      "Lunch",
      "Balinese Pork Satay",
      "$24.90",
      "Dairy-free",
      "Five skewers of aromatic marinated pork, caramelised and served with our smoky sweet soy sauce, refreshing house-made pickles and fresh coriander. Inspired by the bold, fragrant flavours of Balinese street food.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "Extra 2 skewers",
      "+$8.00",
      "Sambal matah",
      "+$2.50",
      "Aromatic rice",
      "+$3.50",
      "Singapore Chilli Crab Omurice",
      "$34.90",
      "A whole crispy soft-shell crab served over a soft omelette and fragrant aromatic rice. Accompanied by our interpretation of Singapore’s iconic chilli crab sauce, with a touch of Indonesian Padang-style influence for added depth and complexity. Served with the sauce separately for pouring and a refreshing cucumber-cabbage salad dressed with coriander, ginger and lime.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "Extra whole soft-shell crab",
      "+$12.00",
      "Tea-Smoked Duck Inaniwa Udon",
      "$24.90",
      "Dairy-free",
      "Delicate Inaniwa udon served chilled in our refreshing kankitsu tare, a citrus-infused Japanese-style sauce with savoury kombu umami and fragrant yuzu notes. Topped with slices of house-made tea-smoked duck breast with lightly crisped skin, a silky soft-cooked egg, shaved daikon, fragrant shiso and crispy Japanese rice crackers.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "Extra duck (3 slices)",
      "+$6.00",
      "Extra ontama",
      "+$2.50",
      "Vegan Sesame-Miso Ma Jiang Mian",
      "$20.90",
      "Vegan · Dairy-free",
      "Our Taiwanese-inspired sesame noodles feature delicate Inaniwa udon coated in a rich, nutty sesame-miso sauce. Topped with savoury braised shiitake and shredded king oyster mushrooms, refreshing cucumber, spring onion and fragrant vegan chilli oil.",
      "Add-ons and options ",
      "+",
      "No chilli oil",
      "$0.00",
      "Extra braised mushrooms (40 g)",
      "+$3.50",
